<title>UK: Sweden sets 200 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 200 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0 PCT   MATURITY    31.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    EBS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
